KNN performed better on the selected test split. These results reflect this particular split and may vary with different data splits.

Evaluation

The models were evaluated using:

Accuracy score

Confusion matrix

Classification report, including precision, recall, and F1-score

Conclusion

The KNN model achieved the higher test accuracy in this experiment. This project provided practical experience in data exploration, visualization, model training, and evaluation.

